{"name":"Pencil Me In","hex":"#fd9f01","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pencil","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A writing utensil with a graphite (commonly referred to as lead) shaft, usually blended with clay, clad in wood, and sharpened to a taper. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","An aggregate or collection of rays of light, especially when diverging from, or converging to, a point."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To write (something) using a pencil.","To mark with, or as if with, a pencil."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pencil"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pencil","blocks":[{"text":"A pencil is a writing or drawing implement with a solid pigment core in a protective casing that reduces the risk of core breakage and keeps it from marking the user's hand."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Pencils_hb.jpg/330px-Pencils_hb.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pencil","wikidata":"Q14674"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Caran_d%27Ache_Farbstifte.JPG/500px-Caran_d%27Ache_Farbstifte.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Caran_d%27Ache_Farbstifte.JPG/1280px-Caran_d%27Ache_Farbstifte.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Caran_d%27Ache_Farbstifte.JPG/500px-Caran_d%27Ache_Farbstifte.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Coloured pencils (Caran d'Ache)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACaran_d'Ache_Farbstifte.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Soviet_made_Iskusstvo_pencils.jpg/330px-Soviet_made_Iskusstvo_pencils.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&u